{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/49eff2cb182326faafd931cc07c5e7ab.webp?t=1766050144\" width=600 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroes of Artadis</strong> is a turn-based PvP strategy game with CCG elements. Assemble a deadly squad of fearless heroes, use destructive spells, win battles, and become the legend of Artadis!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/ab8e26891480ccc4b15f4333e708b2c7.webp?t=1766050144\" width=600 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think strategically to uncover the potential of the squad you build, then dive into the world of turn-based PvP battles. Make the most of each round to outsmart your opponent and strengthen your heroes. Cast spells, use hero abilities, and vanquish the enemy general!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/04dc6f1b4fad52acc8dde20a2906feb7.poster.avif?t=1766050144\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/04dc6f1b4fad52acc8dde20a2906feb7.webm?t=1766050144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/04dc6f1b4fad52acc8dde20a2906feb7.mp4?t=1766050144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/d29bb6b1faaf34245598f7ad0254aab4.webp?t=1766050144\" width=600 height=37 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of the civilizations of Artadis and build an unbeatable squad. Each faction boasts their own set of powerful spells, and every hero has unique abilities that help them in combat. More than 40 heroes<strong> </strong>crave battle right now, and every major update adds new characters to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/af9830565bd4eff60d553f2ede24f265.poster.avif?t=1766050144\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/af9830565bd4eff60d553f2ede24f265.webm?t=1766050144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/af9830565bd4eff60d553f2ede24f265.mp4?t=1766050144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888380/extras/9926cee1ce255d8e26edc5b81abe256b.webp?t=1766050144\" width=600 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in battles and gain experience to become the strongest general of Artadis! Complete various missions to unlock new heroes, get more powerful spells, and refine your strategy. Every hero in the game has their own personality and backstory that will help you learn more about the world of Artadis. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autopl